  "preserved_actor_and_rate_boundary": {
    "server_thread": "Both receive overloads reject null sender/server and non-server-thread calls before state/budget/manager mutation.",
    "authority": "Existing SFMPacketEffectGate accepts only the unpublished private integrated world and exact local owner. Declared capabilities do not grant authority. This proposal does not add gamemaster, LAN or multiplayer signing permission.",
    "target": "Exact dimension, loaded chunk, alive/non-spectator actor, <=8-block squared-distance, mayInteract and loaded/nonremoved ClientManager.",
    "budget": "One weak server-session state; request charges ingress+maximum ack; submission charges ingress+512; denied budget receives no response. Existing Admission preserves per-player/global operation and byte budgets.",
    "cas_and_crypto": "Real manager/save state uses exact incarnation/revision/source and address. Unauthorized signature submission consumes that player's one-use challenge. Existing submitEncoded takes challenge and checks revision/body before parsing public attestation.",
    "acknowledgement": "Response envelope preserves original request/dimension/position/status; ack serializes only actual server-issued review acknowledgement. Client controller still must match pending request/world before decoding.",
    "lifecycle": "Invalidate by incarnation; forget actor on logout/dimension change; remove state and clear budget/reviews on server stop. No persistent reviews and no implicit replenishment on relog."
  },
